From 18dd4821990d819fc937d81674105504d1743c34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:13:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy 0042: no world or national wonder before a
 strike, on every pick path

bullyabort20 game 1 (14BC6621, ab-8555f21) stopped: LateStrike Germany's Munich took
Heroic Epic (T61) and the Temple of Artemis (T62) in strike PREP. The sanity check did
veto both ("SKIPPED ... badtimeorplace"), but it vetoed every other option too, and
CvCityStrategyAI::ChooseProduction then falls back to the unchecked list
(m_Buildables = m_BuildablesPrecheck), wonders and all.

New CvPlayer::IsStrikeNoWonders (IsStrikePending, or the EarlyStrike book window, or
LateStrike BUILDUP) is used on every path a city picks a wonder:
- the sanity check (CvBuildingProductionAI), now for national wonders too;
- the everything-vetoed fallback (CvCityStrategyAI), which drops world and national
  wonders (logged SKIPPED);
- the city specialization's pick (CvCityAI);
- a Great Engineer's wonder (CvHomelandAI), so the engineer is kept.
The strike list's own items are pushed directly and are not filtered.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
---
